<title>UK: Grain bulker refloated on River Plate.</title>
<headline>Grain bulker refloated on River Plate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus-flag bulker Dynamic was refloated with tug assistance on July 21 on the River Plate, Argentina, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said.</p>
<p>The 52,510-dwt vessel arrived at Rosario later the same day to load grain.</p>
</text>
